  "text": "### Risk Assessment Process  \n**Step 1: Identify (Department-Led)**\n- Department lists potential risks\n- Assess process failures, systems, fraud scenarios  \n**Step 2: Score (Risk Team + Department)**\n- Estimate impact and likelihood\n- Consider existing controls\n- Calculate residual risk  \n**Step 3: Mitigate (Department-Led)**\n- Identify control gaps\n- Implement targeted controls\n- Assign responsibility and timeline  \n**Step 4: Monitor (Continuous)**\n- Monitor key risk indicators (KRIs)\n- Adjust controls if needed\n- Escalate if risk increases  \n---",
